    title: "java: WI-kuroj's method_return_type_registry is built in java.py and never passed to _extract_edges (write-only; ADR-0006 Chained ❌) -- var w = F.makeWriter(); w.write() emits java:external across files; WI-doluf's Go Defect 1 in Java"  # 6fdc
